 "remarks": "SHERWOOD FARMS - Set within a private Greens Farms enclave designed by acclaimed architect Roger Ferris, this gracious Westport residence offers four en suite bedrooms, inviting verandas and a private terrace, with access to the association pool and clubhouse.  Nine-foot ceilings and hardwood floors enhance the bright, generously scaled interiors. The kitchen, appointed with granite countertops, opens to a welcoming family room with a fireplace, while a second fireplace anchors the spacious living room. Each of the four bedrooms has its own full bath. Set apart on a separate side of the home, the fourth suite is particularly versatile as a generous bonus room or a private in-law or au pair suite.  The verandas and terrace offer inviting settings for outdoor dining and entertaining. A powder room and attached two-car garage add everyday convenience, and the expansive unfinished lower level offers the opportunity to create additional living space. Enjoy a sought-after Greens Farms location near Westport's beaches, Longshore and the Greens Farms train station.",
